Grants and kill switch
Core's level: Permissive · Kill switch: off

Turn the kill switch on?
Everything "Revoke all" ends, and until you turn it off here: no grant can be issued,
protected actions after untrusted content are refused, the browser and memory writes are
refused, and the credential broker stays closed.
Saved in security_state.json: it holds after a restart. The level stays Permissive.

enter confirm · esc cancel, nothing changes
